      "id": "tab3",
      "title": "Đọc 例文(れいぶん) (ví dụ)",
      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (ví dụ)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111111002.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">1．  </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai10_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">この ビルに ATMが ありますか。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ở tòa nhà này có cây ATM không?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; はい、2<ruby>階<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に あります。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Có, ở tầng 2.</span></div></div></div></p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2．  </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai10_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">あそこに <ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が いますね。 あの <ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は だれですか。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ở chỗ kia có một người đàn ông nhỉ. Anh ấy là ai thế?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip;IMCの <ruby>松本<rp>(</rp><rt>まつもと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんです。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Là anh Matsumoto, nhân viên của Công ty IMC.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3．  </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai10_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>庭<rp>(</rp><rt>にわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に だれが いますか。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ở vườn có ai thế?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; だれも いません。<ruby>猫<rp>(</rp><rt>ねこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が います。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Không có ai cả. Chỉ có con m&egrave;o.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4．  </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai10_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>箱<rp>(</rp><rt>はこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>中<rp>(</rp><rt>なか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありますか。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ở trong hộp có cái g&igrave;?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; <ruby>古<rp>(</rp><rt>ふる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い <ruby>手紙<rp>(</rp><rt>てがみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>や <ruby>写真<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>「など」が あります。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Có những thứ như thư và ảnh cũ.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5．  </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai10_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>郵便局<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうびんきょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は どこに ありますか。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Bưu điện ở đâu?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; <ruby>駅<rp>(</rp><rt>えき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くです。<ruby>銀行<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎんこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に あります。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Ở gần ga, trước ngân hàng.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6．  </span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai10_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">ミラーさんはどこに いますか。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh Miller ở đâu?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; <ruby>会議室<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎしつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に います。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Ở ph&ograve;ng họp.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
